{"availability":"available","full":"ubongn/stellar-nova-esusu","name":"stellar-nova-esusu","description":"Trustless rotating savings (Esusu/Ajo/Stokvel) on Stellar Soroban — two-contract architecture with on-chain reputation, automated default penalties, and eligibility gating. Save together, rotate payouts, build trust. Live demo + 10-slide pitch deck below.","category":"Finance","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-13T09:44:53Z","updated":"2026-09-02T04:34:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://stellar-nova-esusu.vercel.app","topics":["ajo","blockchain","defi","esusu","hackathon","react","rotating-savings","rust","savings","smart-contracts","soroban","stellar","typescript","web3"],"demo":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/13QS_LDAaQnSwsa3NChTEeOV37kr27eCk/view?usp=sharing","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T03:01:35.259Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T03:01:35.259Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T03:01:35.259Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:40:06.697Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T03:01:35.259Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Save together. Rotate payouts. Build reputation.","Nova Esusu brings the centuries-old African rotating savings system (Esusu / Ajo / Adashe) on-chain. Members contribute XLM into a shared pool each round, and one member receives the full pot on a rotating basis — all enforced by smart contracts, with zero intermediaries.","🎥 Watch the demo video — full lifecycle: connect wallet → fund → create circle → join → contribute → payout rotation → dark mode → onboarding guide."],"features":["No transparency — members can't verify who paid what","Default risk — recipients who take the pot and disappear","No recourse — no reputation system, no accountability","Geographic lock — you can only join circles with people you physically know","Create Circles — Set size, contribution amount, cycle count, a